WEBVTT

00:45.145 --> 00:46.313
SOCIAL

00:46.396 --> 00:47.356
SEX

00:47.439 --> 00:49.233
SECRET

00:50.859 --> 00:52.069
SEX LINE

00:52.152 --> 00:54.446
S LINE

00:54.530 --> 00:58.617
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS

01:27.147 --> 01:29.108
Seon-a!

01:29.733 --> 01:31.694
Seon-a, please wake up!

01:32.444 --> 01:33.446
Seon-a!

01:34.488 --> 01:37.074
OPERATING CENTER

01:55.594 --> 01:56.678
Where's Seon-a?

02:14.071 --> 02:15.698
Why were you at school so late at night?

02:17.784 --> 02:19.285
I was looking for Seon-a.

02:22.038 --> 02:23.122
Looking for her?

02:23.915 --> 02:25.291
She called me

02:27.877 --> 02:29.129
on her way to school.

02:32.090 --> 02:33.341
This late at night?

02:37.554 --> 02:38.722
Don't know.

03:00.203 --> 03:01.830
I know one thing for sure.

03:06.167 --> 03:07.127
Seon-a...

03:10.797 --> 03:12.507
didn't try to kill herself.

03:44.374 --> 03:46.043
Is the Korean teacher still not here?

03:46.126 --> 03:47.836
Come on. Someone should try calling him.

03:48.337 --> 03:49.880
What a day to be tardy.

03:52.382 --> 03:54.551
I'm trying to reach him,
but he's not picking up.

03:55.594 --> 03:58.848
How can you let something like this
happen at our school?

03:59.348 --> 04:01.183
She could have killed herself at home.

04:01.267 --> 04:03.311
Why did she do it here
on our school premises?

04:04.020 --> 04:04.979
Excuse me.

04:05.563 --> 04:07.648
I think you just crossed a line.

04:08.274 --> 04:10.443
And for your information,
she hasn't passed yet.

04:10.526 --> 04:13.071
You don't get to preach.

04:13.154 --> 04:14.656
You have just as much accountability.

04:14.739 --> 04:16.825
Yes, I am well aware of that.

04:17.659 --> 04:19.828
We're all responsible for what happened.

04:19.911 --> 04:22.080
What I don't get is
why you're blaming the student.

04:22.164 --> 04:23.915
What the heck are you talking about?

04:23.999 --> 04:26.793
- That's what you're doing.
- I'm not taking this!

04:26.877 --> 04:28.378
I said what I said.

04:28.462 --> 04:30.297
Then let's talk it out at my office!

04:30.381 --> 04:31.548
- Calm down.
- Do you hear me?

04:31.632 --> 04:32.883
- Unbelievable.
- That's enough.

04:32.967 --> 04:34.969
You have no right to be acting out.

04:35.052 --> 04:37.304
- Settle down.
- That's not it.

04:37.388 --> 04:38.472
Are you okay?

04:38.556 --> 04:39.974
I'm already stressed as it is.

04:40.057 --> 04:41.517
You're making things a lot worse.

04:42.143 --> 04:43.978
- Just let it pass.
- Sorry about this.

04:44.062 --> 04:47.857
Anyway, make sure this doesn't get around

04:47.941 --> 04:50.527
and keep quiet about it.

04:50.610 --> 04:52.988
- God, you guys stink of smoke.
- Whatever, we smell nice.

04:53.071 --> 04:54.698
Your teeth are going to turn yellow.

04:54.781 --> 04:55.949
You should try it sometime.

04:56.032 --> 04:58.452
Your teeth are yellow as fuck.
They're like corn.

04:58.535 --> 04:59.703
What?

04:59.786 --> 05:01.788
You guys are hilarious.

05:01.872 --> 05:04.416
Join us for a smoke.

05:04.500 --> 05:05.584
Hey.

05:05.667 --> 05:07.086
Where's Hye-yeong?

05:07.169 --> 05:10.172
What a fucking coincidence,
right after Seon-a falls off the roof.

05:10.756 --> 05:12.883
- Is school too boring without her?
- Maybe.

05:13.509 --> 05:16.178
It's all my fault. She's in my class.

05:16.804 --> 05:17.847
No, don't say that.

05:18.681 --> 05:21.017
The School Violence Prevention Committee
was almost held because of her, right?

05:21.601 --> 05:23.853
Is the Korean teacher still unavailable?

05:24.521 --> 05:27.232
It's strange. This usually never happens.

05:30.735 --> 05:31.987
This is exhausting.

05:32.070 --> 05:33.697
Does anyone have good news for a change?

05:33.780 --> 05:35.449
It's always bullying, suicides...

05:38.535 --> 05:40.662
- Hey, Mr. Kim.
- Yes?

05:40.746 --> 05:42.581
How are the wedding preparations going?

05:42.664 --> 05:43.874
Have you fixed a date?

05:45.209 --> 05:46.502
We called it off.

06:11.737 --> 06:15.657
THE APARTMENT

06:15.741 --> 06:17.659
Come in. You can leave that here.

06:20.371 --> 06:22.831
Are you hiding? A-yul.

06:23.415 --> 06:25.167
Come say hi to your uncle.

06:26.877 --> 06:28.337
Come on.

06:29.088 --> 06:30.089
Here.

06:36.262 --> 06:37.263
A-yul.

06:38.932 --> 06:39.933
Are you feeling shy?

06:41.810 --> 06:43.812
You don't have much luggage.

06:43.895 --> 06:45.605
I'll only be staying for a week.

06:45.689 --> 06:46.982
I shipped the rest of my stuff.

06:47.065 --> 06:50.819
Quitting your job and moving to Canada...
It's so out of the blue.

06:50.903 --> 06:51.862
Gosh.

06:53.363 --> 06:54.406
Have a seat.

06:55.115 --> 06:56.033
Okay.

06:57.076 --> 06:59.662
It's your first time here, right?
How do you like it?

07:01.747 --> 07:02.832
It's great.

07:04.125 --> 07:05.710
You moved here last year, right?

07:05.793 --> 07:07.295
What? No.

07:07.378 --> 07:09.464
It's been over two years.

07:10.381 --> 07:11.758
Time flies.

07:13.259 --> 07:16.137
It's all thanks to Mr. Kim Byeong-cheol.

07:16.221 --> 07:17.472
Right?

07:17.555 --> 07:19.140
So that would be my brother-in-law?

07:21.017 --> 07:22.102
What was that?

07:22.978 --> 07:24.604
Is he okay with me staying here?

07:25.439 --> 07:27.232
Why not? You're my little brother.

07:29.318 --> 07:32.529
Plus, he's way too busy.
He won't be around much.

07:32.613 --> 07:33.447
Let me have a look.

07:35.407 --> 07:36.492
All done.

07:36.575 --> 07:39.578
You'll be going to work
up until the departure date, right?

07:40.454 --> 07:41.330
Yeah.

07:42.707 --> 07:43.749
Just a second.

07:53.301 --> 07:54.386
Kang Seon-a.

07:57.222 --> 07:59.141
Wake up and say something.

08:37.681 --> 08:39.099
You must be looking for evidence.

08:40.475 --> 08:41.602
For Seon-a, right?

08:44.271 --> 08:48.567
I know her. She's one bitter bitch.

08:48.651 --> 08:51.779
Suicide? It's ridiculous.

08:52.530 --> 08:55.449
And Kim Hye-yeong,
who's been bullying Seon-a every day,

08:55.533 --> 08:57.618
skipped school the very next day.

08:58.661 --> 09:00.288
Now that's suspicious.

09:02.123 --> 09:03.124
Who are you?

09:03.208 --> 09:05.126
I'm Lee Gyeong-jin from Class 5.

09:06.211 --> 09:09.130
Assuming that this is
not a suicide but a murder,

09:09.214 --> 09:12.509
the number one suspect is the person
who was closest to the victim.

09:13.218 --> 09:15.053
But Seon-a was a loner.

09:16.847 --> 09:17.723
No, wait.

09:18.348 --> 09:21.352
Recently, she had some people
she hung around with.

09:22.102 --> 09:23.228
She's not dead.

09:23.854 --> 09:26.023
- What?
- Seon-a's still alive.

09:28.818 --> 09:30.403
True. Sorry.

09:32.321 --> 09:34.490
That reminds me,
you were friends with her.

10:04.647 --> 10:05.856
Where did you get these?

10:07.608 --> 10:09.485
An optical store.

10:09.569 --> 10:10.778
When?

10:12.363 --> 10:14.657
- Last year.
- How come you didn't wear them till now?

10:16.117 --> 10:18.453
I wore contacts but they hurt my eyes.

10:54.032 --> 10:55.075
Excuse me.

10:55.742 --> 10:56.743
Yes?

10:57.410 --> 10:59.329
Do you happen to know who these belong to?

11:12.134 --> 11:13.677
I'm not sure.

11:15.471 --> 11:16.305
Why do you ask?

11:17.139 --> 11:18.808
They were on my desk.

11:20.434 --> 11:22.061
They must be yours, then.

11:22.645 --> 11:24.647
Try them on. I bet they suit you.

11:25.898 --> 11:26.899
Sure.

12:41.519 --> 12:42.562
It's all my fault.

12:44.355 --> 12:46.441
I should have taken better care of her.

12:49.277 --> 12:52.614
I was her homeroom teacher
and I had no idea what was bothering her.

12:53.949 --> 12:55.409
So you think it was a suicide attempt?

12:59.204 --> 13:00.622
- Sorry?
- It hasn't...

13:02.291 --> 13:03.959
been ruled as a suicide yet.

13:08.673 --> 13:09.799
Either way,

13:11.634 --> 13:13.928
I'm ready to help you if you need me.

13:15.138 --> 13:16.598
Call me whenever.

13:18.600 --> 13:22.103
Is the student that bullied Seon-a
here today?

13:25.440 --> 13:26.942
That student

13:27.859 --> 13:29.069
is missing as of now.

13:29.152 --> 13:30.654
Missing?

13:32.489 --> 13:33.448
Yes.

13:44.627 --> 13:46.212
What about this student?

13:49.674 --> 13:51.676
I found this in Seon-a's bag.

13:51.759 --> 13:53.469
Seems it was taken
on the day of the accident.

14:14.658 --> 14:15.784
Are you Lee Ji-won?

14:15.868 --> 14:16.869
Yes.

14:17.703 --> 14:19.413
I'll get to the point.

14:21.082 --> 14:22.583
Were you in a relationship with Seon-a?

14:25.670 --> 14:26.963
No.

14:31.092 --> 14:32.218
If you weren't,

14:32.302 --> 14:34.220
why were you two on a date?

14:34.304 --> 14:35.722
She wanted to meet up.

14:35.805 --> 14:37.224
- And you always say yes?
- Why not?

14:39.392 --> 14:40.477
You know.

14:42.479 --> 14:43.605
It was kind of interesting.

14:45.065 --> 14:47.901
It was as if the loner
suddenly became a different person.

14:48.986 --> 14:51.614
I knew she was always into me.

15:05.211 --> 15:07.255
Did you notice anything strange
while with her?

15:09.090 --> 15:10.050
Well...

15:11.259 --> 15:12.260
Not really.

15:14.554 --> 15:15.722
What about at the cafe?

15:17.265 --> 15:18.725
Can I be honest with you?

15:23.188 --> 15:24.356
We talked and then made out.

15:25.566 --> 15:27.693
I wanted a little more

15:27.776 --> 15:29.028
but she didn't.

15:31.530 --> 15:32.907
And then what?

15:36.911 --> 15:37.870
Oh, I remember.

15:38.538 --> 15:40.123
We took a picture

15:40.206 --> 15:42.417
but then she started
running off somewhere.

15:43.001 --> 15:45.128
She said she lost something.

16:14.117 --> 16:16.869
HAN JI-UK

16:16.953 --> 16:20.081
OH DONG-SIK

16:36.432 --> 16:37.433
SINU GREEN PARK (1)

16:55.410 --> 17:02.417
SINU GREEN PARK (2)

17:23.230 --> 17:24.815
- Cheers.
- Right.

17:24.899 --> 17:25.858
Cheers.

17:40.123 --> 17:42.959
I'm sorry I came to stay out of the blue.

17:43.043 --> 17:45.587
- Hey.
- It's fine. Don't be.

17:47.172 --> 17:48.006
Jeong-u.

17:49.174 --> 17:50.676
That's your name, right?

17:51.385 --> 17:53.220
Yes. There's no need to be so formal.

17:53.929 --> 17:55.014
By the way,

17:55.931 --> 17:56.974
you two

17:57.808 --> 18:00.019
- don't look alike at all.
- What?

18:00.102 --> 18:01.270
He's so handsome.

18:05.983 --> 18:07.151
Cheers.

18:12.449 --> 18:14.200
Can I ask you something?

18:15.243 --> 18:16.077
Go ahead.

18:17.120 --> 18:20.332
I heard you almost got married.
What happened?

18:21.708 --> 18:24.628
Honey, don't...

18:24.711 --> 18:26.964
It's okay. Let him talk.

18:28.966 --> 18:30.801
We'd been living together for a while

18:32.470 --> 18:34.305
but not long before the wedding,

18:35.598 --> 18:38.309
I came home early from work
and saw her in bed with my friend.

18:41.187 --> 18:44.274
Goodness, Jeong-u.

18:45.692 --> 18:47.235
You made the right call.

18:48.236 --> 18:49.946
Having it happen before the wedding

18:50.030 --> 18:53.116
is the best luck you can get.

18:54.284 --> 18:55.452
I really like this guy.

18:55.535 --> 18:56.870
Come on, let me pour you one.

18:56.953 --> 18:57.955
Thanks.

19:02.251 --> 19:03.335
Top me off, too.

19:03.877 --> 19:05.087
- You okay?
- Yeah.

19:06.672 --> 19:07.923
There we go.

19:19.936 --> 19:20.853
What the heck?

19:20.937 --> 19:22.814
- Sorry about this.
- No worries.

19:23.773 --> 19:25.859
They're all from work.

19:26.735 --> 19:28.028
So many texts...

19:30.739 --> 19:32.741
What subject did you say you teach?

19:33.408 --> 19:34.618
I teach English.

19:42.543 --> 19:47.173
I sometimes meet people
from other countries because of work.

19:47.757 --> 19:48.716
Jeong-u.

19:49.342 --> 19:52.512
Do you know what people
visiting Korea love the best?

19:54.555 --> 19:55.598
Guess.

19:56.766 --> 19:58.685
Go on.

20:04.691 --> 20:06.943
It's been a while
since you talked to your sister, right?

20:07.027 --> 20:09.905
Yes. I didn't take her calls too often.

20:11.657 --> 20:12.533
Well.

20:12.616 --> 20:14.868
Stay in touch from now on.

20:15.452 --> 20:18.247
You're the only family to each other
since your parents passed.

20:18.330 --> 20:19.415
That's right.

20:20.583 --> 20:21.584
I'll stay in touch.

20:29.759 --> 20:31.260
Hello.

20:38.476 --> 20:40.020
Oops.

21:18.310 --> 21:19.478
Jeong-u, where are you going?

21:20.479 --> 21:22.272
We live on the tenth floor.

21:22.356 --> 21:23.315
Oh, right.

21:23.982 --> 21:26.568
You can't hold your liquor very well,
can you?

21:28.904 --> 21:30.864
I'm telling you.
It wasn't a suicide attempt.

21:30.948 --> 21:32.825
You can't close this case.

21:32.908 --> 21:35.286
What do you mean, Detective Han?

21:35.911 --> 21:37.621
We heard what the doctor said.

21:38.205 --> 21:39.624
No signs of foul play.

21:50.135 --> 21:51.344
Be honest with me.

21:52.137 --> 21:55.182
Were you aware
that your niece was getting bullied?

21:58.101 --> 21:59.895
There's a possibility
of it being a suicide attempt.

22:00.896 --> 22:04.942
All the more reason for us to investigate.
It might not be one!

22:05.025 --> 22:06.151
Ji-uk.

22:06.235 --> 22:07.611
The top brass want this closed.

22:09.281 --> 22:11.323
The school foundation's fed up with it.

22:11.407 --> 22:13.117
Suicide's bad enough.

22:13.142 --> 22:15.953
But a homicide? They'll throw a fit.

22:18.059 --> 22:19.957
I know how you feel.

22:20.500 --> 22:21.626
But just let it go.

22:22.961 --> 22:23.962
Will you?

22:30.051 --> 22:31.928
What if it were your kid?

22:38.810 --> 22:39.812
What the...

22:42.147 --> 22:44.149
You just crossed a line.

22:45.234 --> 22:46.986
You crossed it first.

22:49.447 --> 22:50.573
What?

22:50.656 --> 22:52.992
Hey. Ji-uk!

23:05.005 --> 23:07.549
ENTER PASSCODE

23:07.632 --> 23:09.676
For fuck's sake.

23:10.385 --> 23:12.888
It's impossible to bypass.
They can't do it even in the States.

23:17.851 --> 23:20.729
PHYSICS, LEE GYU-JIN

23:29.363 --> 23:31.991
You have the glasses on.
They really suit you.

23:32.742 --> 23:33.701
Thanks.

23:36.704 --> 23:38.623
The Korean teacher
must be still unavailable.

23:40.875 --> 23:42.085
Looks like it.

23:58.561 --> 23:59.770
If you found out

24:00.396 --> 24:02.982
someone you knew was having an affair,

24:04.150 --> 24:05.276
what would you do?

24:07.320 --> 24:08.488
Well...

24:11.741 --> 24:15.620
Is it something that happened for sure?

24:24.087 --> 24:26.381
I'd let everybody know

24:27.132 --> 24:28.842
and let all hell break loose.

24:30.135 --> 24:32.596
Like a scene from a soap opera.

24:34.849 --> 24:35.850
I see.

24:42.315 --> 24:44.275
You were so shy at first.

24:44.358 --> 24:45.693
Now Uncle's your favorite?

24:45.777 --> 24:46.903
A-yul.

24:47.403 --> 24:48.905
Hold Mommy's hand, too.

24:51.616 --> 24:54.703
You're a funny little kid.

24:54.786 --> 24:56.538
- Who's Oh Tae-seok?
- What?

24:58.331 --> 24:59.541
That's been misdelivered.

25:00.042 --> 25:01.335
It's the right address, though.

25:01.835 --> 25:03.337
No, it belongs to Unit 401.

25:03.420 --> 25:05.714
They sometimes add the wrong address.
I'll take it to them.

25:05.798 --> 25:07.633
No, you take A-yul inside. I'll go.

25:09.551 --> 25:11.345
Just drop it off at the security office.

25:11.428 --> 25:12.721
Sure thing.

25:13.389 --> 25:14.724
Want to try opening the door?

25:14.807 --> 25:16.475
OH TAE-SEOK, UNIT 1002

25:16.559 --> 25:17.435
Unit 401?

26:26.090 --> 26:29.051
Hey, babe. I'm almost home.

26:31.095 --> 26:32.805
The shopping bags are so heavy.

26:33.973 --> 26:35.641
You said I could buy whatever I wanted.

26:39.521 --> 26:40.897
There's another parcel.

26:48.363 --> 26:50.532
No, it's not mine. It's yours.

26:51.199 --> 26:52.242
Well...

26:52.910 --> 26:53.952
I'm not sure.

27:08.467 --> 27:10.470
RECIPIENT: OH TAE-SEOK

27:13.306 --> 27:15.266
RECIPIENT: KWAK CHAE-RIN

27:16.184 --> 27:17.268
Kwak Chae-rin.

27:38.999 --> 27:41.919
A-yul, let's say hello to Grandma.

27:43.546 --> 27:44.630
Okay.

27:44.714 --> 27:46.340
Let's say hello.

28:07.863 --> 28:09.406
- Where's Byeong-cheol?
- What?

28:10.324 --> 28:11.408
He's in Gumi.

28:14.453 --> 28:15.704
Is he not coming home today too?

28:16.997 --> 28:18.457
When he visits the factories in Gumi,

28:18.541 --> 28:20.835
he spends two or three nights there.

28:28.301 --> 28:29.636
How is married life?

28:31.554 --> 28:35.267
It's good.
Raising a kid like everyone else.

28:38.103 --> 28:40.147
You should get a facial or something.

28:40.230 --> 28:41.940
Byeong-cheol makes enough money.

28:45.944 --> 28:49.406
You've changed a lot,
nagging me like that.

28:53.995 --> 28:55.788
Mom should've seen this.

29:02.378 --> 29:04.047
Jeong-u.

29:05.924 --> 29:07.759
About your breakup...

29:09.260 --> 29:12.389
It wasn't because your ex
and her family didn't like the fact

29:12.472 --> 29:14.307
that you had no parents, was it?

29:15.976 --> 29:17.269
It wasn't.

29:18.353 --> 29:20.564
I told you. She was cheating on me.

29:28.072 --> 29:30.908
It's nice to have you with me
on the day Mom passed away.

29:32.869 --> 29:34.453
For Dad's...

29:41.294 --> 29:43.880
You're not in touch with
Dad's side of the family, are you?

29:44.547 --> 29:45.590
Well...

29:46.466 --> 29:49.761
Sometimes Uncle calls and...

29:50.429 --> 29:51.722
Are you out of your mind?

29:53.098 --> 29:55.976
Have you forgotten what it did to Mom
after Dad cheated on her?

29:57.811 --> 29:59.605
How could you speak to them?

29:59.688 --> 30:00.814
I just...

30:01.398 --> 30:04.652
You were too young
to understand at the time, but...

30:11.701 --> 30:13.786
I was just going to marry Su-yeon.

30:17.248 --> 30:20.001
We'd been living together for six years.
I was going to let it go.

30:21.252 --> 30:22.379
She swore it was a mistake.

30:23.838 --> 30:26.216
She was on her knees saying she was sorry.

30:30.345 --> 30:31.680
But one day...

30:34.975 --> 30:36.685
I could see Dad's face.

30:39.730 --> 30:41.899
Dad probably said he was sorry at first.

30:44.235 --> 30:45.903
Is this how Mom would have felt?

30:49.615 --> 30:51.701
The face of the girl I loved so much

30:53.203 --> 30:56.414
kept reminding me of
the person I despised most.

30:58.792 --> 31:00.293
I still love Su-yeon.

31:01.962 --> 31:03.046
I miss her.

31:05.465 --> 31:07.593
But I can't see her because of Dad.

31:12.056 --> 31:14.642
The man's ruining my life from his grave.

31:21.732 --> 31:24.152
- This is crazy.
- What on earth?

31:24.235 --> 31:25.528
Is this actually true?

31:25.611 --> 31:27.488
Not a day goes by
without some kind of commotion.

31:27.572 --> 31:28.948
Unbelievable.

31:29.032 --> 31:30.950
- I never thought...
- Is that him?

31:31.034 --> 31:33.578
- The Korean teacher...
- How is this possible?

31:34.454 --> 31:36.748
Hey, come on over here, quick.

31:36.831 --> 31:38.750
It's Kim Hye-yeong and the Korean teacher.

31:38.834 --> 31:40.335
- This is unreal.
- Wow.

31:40.419 --> 31:42.129
- Are you kidding me?
- You're lying.

31:42.212 --> 31:44.464
- This is insane!
- Come on.

31:45.048 --> 31:46.216
This is nuts.

31:46.300 --> 31:48.093
Is this for real?

31:48.177 --> 31:52.181
DO NOT CROSS, UNDER INVESTIGATION

31:53.390 --> 31:54.975
I am Bang Seong-jin.

31:55.685 --> 31:58.187
I teach Korean at Bangju High School.

31:59.814 --> 32:01.149
For a while, I have been

32:02.150 --> 32:04.485
in an inappropriate relationship
with a student.

32:06.237 --> 32:07.697
I apologize to my family.

32:08.656 --> 32:10.575
The humiliation and guilt
that will overwhelm me

32:11.326 --> 32:13.036
when this comes to light

32:14.538 --> 32:16.373
has led me to end my own life.

32:19.418 --> 32:22.963
I am sincerely sorry
for causing such trouble.

32:23.547 --> 32:25.132
Hey, don't touch that.

32:26.258 --> 32:27.384
I've got my gloves on.

32:28.761 --> 32:33.057
SUICIDE NOTE

32:33.140 --> 32:35.852
I AM BANG SEONG-JIN,
I TEACH KOREAN AT BANGJU HIGH SCHOOL...

32:38.604 --> 32:40.315
What's the estimated time of death?

32:42.108 --> 32:42.984
Well...

32:45.111 --> 32:47.364
We'll need an autopsy to confirm that

32:47.447 --> 32:49.574
but I heard it's been at least three days
since he died.

32:59.084 --> 33:00.794
Doesn't seem like it happened here.

33:01.795 --> 33:02.630
What?

33:04.048 --> 33:06.342
This car's sitting
in the middle of this parking lot

33:06.884 --> 33:08.552
and nobody sees him for three days?

33:08.636 --> 33:11.180
The pictures were posted today.

33:14.016 --> 33:16.227
He knew it was going to come out.

33:18.229 --> 33:20.273
Someone's behind all of this.

33:24.653 --> 33:25.779
Hey, Prez!

33:27.280 --> 33:29.199
We're going for some tteokbokki.
Want to join us?

33:32.035 --> 33:33.120
- Sure.
- Really?

33:34.413 --> 33:35.914
You never want to join me.

33:37.332 --> 33:39.919
Are you into me or something?

33:43.339 --> 33:45.424
Or maybe it's Hyeon-heup
you're interested in.

33:53.474 --> 34:00.440
BANGJU HIGH SCHOOL

34:07.030 --> 34:08.907
- Hey. Get in the car.
- Who are you?

34:10.576 --> 34:11.660
Do you know this guy?

34:12.953 --> 34:14.413
He's my neighbor.

34:14.496 --> 34:16.498
It's illegal to park here. Get in, quick.

34:18.375 --> 34:19.794
Hey, mister.

34:19.877 --> 34:21.712
Who are you to tell us what to do?

34:21.796 --> 34:22.755
Mister?

34:22.838 --> 34:25.925
Yeah, that's right.
Are you trying to kidnap us?

34:26.008 --> 34:28.261
It's a pretty bold-faced attempt.

34:28.344 --> 34:30.013
You're one crazy dude.

34:30.096 --> 34:34.184
Hey, call the police. Come on.

34:34.267 --> 34:36.728
You want the police? Just a second.

34:38.355 --> 34:40.941
Hey, look. The police just got here.

34:42.234 --> 34:43.235
Hop in. Quick.

34:46.029 --> 34:47.990
You never dropped by.
I thought we were friends.

34:54.580 --> 34:56.415
I'm not suspecting you or anything.

34:57.541 --> 34:59.085
You said it yourself.

34:59.669 --> 35:01.254
She had no reason to kill herself.

35:03.506 --> 35:05.883
Why do you think Seon-a
went back to school so late at night?

35:12.724 --> 35:15.268
Have you seen

35:16.728 --> 35:17.729
Seon-a's glasses?

35:19.690 --> 35:20.524
Glasses?

35:27.740 --> 35:29.116
Tell me the truth.

35:30.492 --> 35:31.869
What do the glasses mean?

35:32.453 --> 35:34.413
Does Seon-a also have
something to do with them?

35:37.333 --> 35:38.376
The glasses.

35:39.794 --> 35:40.920
You have to find them.

35:42.171 --> 35:43.756
Then I'll tell you.

35:48.136 --> 35:49.679
Tell me what?

36:21.379 --> 36:22.213
Taxi!

36:31.340 --> 36:34.844
HOTEL

36:34.935 --> 36:36.061
The key's inside.

36:43.153 --> 36:45.196
Let's just start eating.

36:46.947 --> 36:48.115
Are you done now?

37:02.339 --> 37:04.424
Wait. What's this doing here?

37:05.133 --> 37:07.052
Oh, my gosh!

37:08.887 --> 37:09.721
What is it?

37:14.435 --> 37:15.644
It's beautiful.

37:24.528 --> 37:26.572
- This is embarrassing.
- Come on.

37:27.406 --> 37:28.491
Let's see.

37:29.283 --> 37:30.284
There.

37:36.666 --> 37:37.584
Let's eat.

37:42.798 --> 37:44.091
Hello?

37:44.174 --> 37:46.426
Hi, Byeong-cheol. This is Jeong-u.

37:46.510 --> 37:47.511
Hey.

37:53.851 --> 37:55.978
Jeong-u, what's up?

37:57.229 --> 37:58.606
Is this a bad time?

37:58.689 --> 38:01.776
I'm in the middle of a meeting.

38:01.859 --> 38:03.110
I can't really talk.

38:04.070 --> 38:04.987
Where are you?

38:05.780 --> 38:06.781
Now?

38:08.074 --> 38:09.200
I'm not in Seoul.

38:09.909 --> 38:12.579
I'll give you a call when I can.

38:12.647 --> 38:13.648
Byeong-cheol.

38:15.837 --> 38:17.088
I can't get a hold of my sister.

38:20.045 --> 38:21.004
Really?

38:22.339 --> 38:25.217
In that case,

38:25.926 --> 38:28.095
I'll try calling her.

38:29.805 --> 38:31.015
Okay? Got to go now.

38:40.983 --> 38:44.362
ROOM NO. 2407

39:13.476 --> 39:14.685
Just a minute, okay, babe?

39:43.382 --> 39:45.634
- Who is it?
- Room service.

39:51.265 --> 39:52.683
Hey!

39:55.436 --> 39:56.479
Jeong-u.

39:57.855 --> 39:58.856
Let go of me.

40:00.191 --> 40:01.276
Let go.

40:01.776 --> 40:03.486
What the hell do you think you're doing?

40:13.413 --> 40:15.916
I'd like to ask you the same question.

40:18.085 --> 40:19.295
Well, I...

40:21.380 --> 40:23.632
Jeong-u, I understand

40:24.800 --> 40:27.470
how all of this may look to you.

40:29.222 --> 40:31.140
But you have to respect my privacy.

40:32.642 --> 40:33.977
I mean...

40:35.603 --> 40:38.398
This does no good for your sister.

40:39.107 --> 40:40.400
You're so brazen.

40:42.360 --> 40:45.906
Shouldn't you be apologizing first?

40:46.823 --> 40:49.910
You're right. Okay, I'm sorry.

40:51.620 --> 40:53.664
I have no words for how sorry I am.

40:54.415 --> 40:55.541
Wait!

40:59.545 --> 41:00.546
Okay.

41:01.088 --> 41:04.467
I'll break it off today, right here.

41:06.177 --> 41:07.386
I swear.

41:07.470 --> 41:10.348
Just give me a little more time.

41:11.432 --> 41:13.143
I mean it. I'm serious.

41:14.144 --> 41:15.186
Will you?

41:19.482 --> 41:21.109
End it today.

41:22.527 --> 41:24.655
Otherwise, who knows what I'll do.

41:26.990 --> 41:28.575
Jeong-u.

41:29.368 --> 41:31.078
Don't tell your sister.

41:36.667 --> 41:38.336
When will we meet again once you leave?

41:39.420 --> 41:42.757
We only just got back in touch.

41:49.138 --> 41:50.974
Canada's not that far away.

41:53.018 --> 41:54.519
I'll call you often.

41:56.146 --> 41:57.147
You do that.

41:57.230 --> 41:59.566
Call me, if something's up.

42:02.653 --> 42:05.656
A-yul's going to miss you
when she wakes up.

42:07.908 --> 42:10.035
Here, this isn't much.

42:10.703 --> 42:11.745
It's for you to spend.

42:12.288 --> 42:14.165
- You shouldn't have.
- Go.

42:21.297 --> 42:23.925
Has Byeong-cheol still not called?

42:24.008 --> 42:25.051
What?

42:26.386 --> 42:27.971
He'll call when he can.

42:28.555 --> 42:30.265
He must be busy.

42:31.349 --> 42:32.517
Call me.

42:33.143 --> 42:34.686
I will. You don't need to see me off.

43:00.171 --> 43:01.589
The soap opera thing.

43:03.133 --> 43:04.426
Did you take care of it?

43:06.678 --> 43:07.679
Not really.

43:08.513 --> 43:09.639
I don't think so.

43:10.849 --> 43:11.892
Perhaps I did.

43:15.187 --> 43:17.231
It's bad enough
that things are chaotic here.

43:17.981 --> 43:22.027
I'm sad to hear
that you are leaving as well.

43:24.446 --> 43:25.823
Thanks for everything.

43:25.906 --> 43:27.199
It's nothing.

43:28.993 --> 43:31.621
Have they found Kim Hye-yeong?

43:33.498 --> 43:34.999
No, not yet.

43:37.460 --> 43:39.337
Who do you think posted the pictures?

43:40.672 --> 43:41.715
Well...

43:42.465 --> 43:44.134
There are plenty of people who would.

43:44.217 --> 43:47.971
There are rumors that the pictures were
all over social media even before that.

44:06.073 --> 44:07.074
"Chae-rin."

44:11.913 --> 44:17.085
KWAK CHAE-RIN

44:23.133 --> 44:26.678
GOING FOR A DRIVE
IT'S BEEN SO LONG

44:32.476 --> 44:34.603
YOU'RE THE BEST, BABE
I'M SO TOUCHED

44:34.687 --> 44:36.397
Let's see. There.

44:37.648 --> 44:41.485
NEW POST

44:46.032 --> 44:49.202
#PREGNANCY REVEAL
#WELCOMING MY BABY

44:49.285 --> 44:51.871
#SEE YOU NEXT YEAR LITTLE ONE

44:54.040 --> 44:55.959
That bastard.

44:57.168 --> 45:00.422
NO ENTRY

45:00.505 --> 45:02.799
Your call could not be connected
and has been forwarded...

45:04.551 --> 45:06.094
Hello. Can I help you?

45:06.178 --> 45:07.679
We're trying to get inside the complex.

45:07.763 --> 45:09.306
Sorry, I'll only be a minute.

45:09.390 --> 45:12.142
Sir. Excuse me, sir!

45:28.284 --> 45:30.495
Oh, my goodness.

45:30.578 --> 45:31.871
You have to stop!

45:31.955 --> 45:34.666
Stop! I said, stop!

45:34.749 --> 45:36.668
Oh, no!

45:36.752 --> 45:37.919
Oh, my goodness!

45:39.671 --> 45:41.632
What's up with that person?

45:41.715 --> 45:43.509
Somebody, please call the police.

45:43.592 --> 45:44.593
Oh, no!

45:44.676 --> 45:46.053
What's going on?

45:46.136 --> 45:47.805
Are you okay?

45:47.888 --> 45:49.932
- What's going on?
- The person did it on purpose.

45:50.015 --> 45:52.893
- You have to stop.
- Come on.

45:52.977 --> 45:54.395
Are you okay?

45:54.478 --> 45:56.898
- Oh, my gosh.
- What's going on?

45:59.692 --> 46:00.735
Gyeong-mi.

46:02.946 --> 46:03.988
Are you okay?

46:06.074 --> 46:07.784
Open the door.

46:08.868 --> 46:10.287
That scared me.

46:17.169 --> 46:18.420
Are you okay?

46:22.841 --> 46:24.176
I'll take care of this.

46:24.760 --> 46:25.761
Take A-yul and--

46:25.845 --> 46:26.846
Jeong-u.

46:28.180 --> 46:29.682
Why did you do it?

46:31.684 --> 46:33.394
What do you mean?

46:34.395 --> 46:35.730
Why did you do it?

46:36.689 --> 46:37.982
What are you talking about?

46:39.609 --> 46:41.653
Why did you have to do that?

46:48.869 --> 46:50.203
What the hell...

46:56.835 --> 46:58.796
- You...
- Babe!

47:00.881 --> 47:01.882
Hey.

47:04.552 --> 47:05.886
- Are you okay?
- Babe...

47:06.554 --> 47:10.516
That woman just crashed her car
into mine out of nowhere, and...

47:10.600 --> 47:12.060
Everything's okay.

47:13.186 --> 47:14.228
I'm sorry this happened.

47:19.609 --> 47:20.902
Let go of me, you punk.

47:21.611 --> 47:22.821
- Oh, my.
- Oh, my.

47:23.613 --> 47:26.032
You're no better than an animal.
You bastard!

47:26.116 --> 47:27.576
Let go, for fuck's sake!

47:27.659 --> 47:28.702
Stop!

47:29.536 --> 47:31.121
Stop.

47:31.205 --> 47:32.956
Stop it, Jeong-u.

47:33.999 --> 47:35.209
Damn it.

47:37.711 --> 47:39.171
Babe, what's going on?

47:40.089 --> 47:41.507
They're just some crazy people.

47:41.590 --> 47:42.675
Come on.

47:50.600 --> 47:52.435
That's not my husband.

47:54.187 --> 47:56.022
That person is not Kim Byeong-cheol.

48:00.944 --> 48:03.113
That man's name is Oh Tae-seok.

48:05.449 --> 48:07.367
He's that woman's husband.

48:10.245 --> 48:13.582
He came here
in case I tried to kill his pregnant wife.

48:14.667 --> 48:15.960
Jeong-u.

48:16.669 --> 48:17.712
I...

48:20.131 --> 48:21.132
I'm...

48:22.884 --> 48:24.802
I'm the other woman.

48:27.388 --> 48:28.473
What are you saying?

48:30.975 --> 48:32.268
I was told what you said.

48:35.772 --> 48:38.275
You wanted him to end the affair.

48:44.239 --> 48:46.075
Jeong-u saw me and Chae-rin together.

48:47.910 --> 48:49.787
He wanted me to end the affair.

48:51.497 --> 48:52.790
Chae-rin's pregnant.

48:54.583 --> 48:55.918
I think it's time.

49:22.654 --> 49:24.782
What the hell is wrong with you?

49:24.865 --> 49:26.742
You've destroyed my car.

49:28.327 --> 49:29.578
I can't believe this.

49:41.424 --> 49:42.842
Mommy.

49:51.768 --> 49:53.770
Why are you crying, Uncle?

49:54.271 --> 49:55.939
Is Mommy hurt?

49:58.275 --> 49:59.276
No.

50:01.236 --> 50:02.696
Everything's okay, A-yul.

50:05.074 --> 50:06.367
I AM SINCERELY SORRY...

50:06.450 --> 50:09.203
What a sloppy suicide note.

50:13.875 --> 50:14.876
Suicide note.

50:18.796 --> 50:19.798
Suicide note?

50:24.297 --> 50:26.018
- Where are you going?
- Home.

50:30.851 --> 50:32.811
And I thought you lived here.

51:27.285 --> 51:33.082
MISEONG MOTEL

51:48.223 --> 51:53.479
URGENT: RECEPTIONIST WANTED
MISEONG MOTEL

52:00.611 --> 52:01.696
Hey, you! Sunglasses!

52:05.908 --> 52:08.119
Why aren't you taking my calls?

52:08.203 --> 52:09.287
What's your phone for?

52:15.710 --> 52:18.296
Did the pair of glasses look like this?

52:38.734 --> 52:41.487
The glasses Seon-a was wearing.
Are these the ones?

52:43.239 --> 52:45.158
What do these glasses make you see?

52:47.660 --> 52:48.662
S line.

52:50.372 --> 52:51.581
S line?

53:30.163 --> 53:31.081
So you're saying

53:31.373 --> 53:34.042
that someone took Seon-a's glasses,

53:34.543 --> 53:37.463
called her to the school rooftop,
and then pushed her.

53:37.671 --> 53:40.466
she was threatening people
about their S lines.

53:41.050 --> 53:42.843
Stupid virgin.

53:43.427 --> 53:44.553
Teacher

53:45.221 --> 53:46.931
Do you have a girlfriend?

53:47.014 --> 53:48.266
I have had

53:48.975 --> 53:51.936
many men as lovers in my life.

53:52.770 --> 53:54.314
What exactly are those glasses?

53:54.939 --> 53:58.902
They show who people have had sex with.

53:58.902 --> 54:00.862
Yet another gruesome murder took place

54:00.862 --> 54:03.114
yesterday evening in Gangam-dong.

54:03.114 --> 54:05.617
Could there be
more than one pair of the glasses?

54:06.481 --> 54:07.786
The glasses might not be...

54:09.605 --> 54:11.107
the only pair.

54:13.250 --> 54:16.086
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS
